{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-2","name":"プロデューサー","text":"────さ、どうぞだ","trans":"────来，请吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-6","name":"プロデューサー","text":"はは、こんなのがプレゼントでほんとにいいのか？\r\nドライブ、楽しんでくれたら嬉しいけど","trans":"哈哈，这种东西当礼物真的好吗？\n兜风能让你开心的话我就高兴了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901035450020","name":"凛世","text":"は、はい……\r\n────あの……！","trans":"是、是的……\n────那个……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901035450030","name":"凛世","text":"その……あの……\r\nもう一点──────","trans":"那个……就是……\n还有一点──────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901035450040","name":"凛世","text":"────じょ、助手席に……","trans":"────副、副驾驶座……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901035450050","name":"凛世","text":"助手席に……乗っても……\r\nかまいませんでしょうか…………！","trans":"副驾驶座……我可以……\n坐上去吗…………！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}